/**
 * /bible  — Bible Reader Page
 *
 * Layout (desktop):  [Header] [ReadingColumn | NotesPanel]
 * Layout (mobile):   [Header] [ReadingColumn] [NotesPanel (collapsed/expanded)]
 *
 * Component tree:
 *   BiblePage
 *   ├─ ReaderHeader       (book/chapter nav, notes-panel toggle on mobile)
 *   ├─ SelectionToolbar   (floats above selection)
 *   ├─ NoteEditor         (modal, appears on "Add Note")
 *   ├─ ReadingColumn
 *   │   └─ VerseBlock × N
 *   └─ NotesPanel
 *       └─ NoteCard × N
 */

